562
00:24:27,533 --> 00:24:29,133
The thing is ,

563
00:24:29,167 --> 00:24:31,633
when I was in there I swear , as God is my witness ,

564
00:24:33,333 --> 00:24:35,133
I heard , I ...

565
00:24:35,167 --> 00:24:37,767
