782
00:34:03,667 --> 00:34:05,300
MICHAEL : There 's another shot there . Look .

783
00:34:06,500 --> 00:34:08,433
Remarkable .

784
00:34:08,467 --> 00:34:10,067
Now we 've seen , Dr Pascoe ...

785
00:34:10,100 --> 00:34:13,667
We 've seen the evidence that you 've collected so far .

786
00:34:15,133 --> 00:34:16,467
I 'd like your theory .

787
00:34:16,500 --> 00:34:18,467
From what we 've seen , do you think that the

788
00:34:18,500 --> 00:34:20,533
poltergeist activity , such that it is ,

789
00:34:20,567 --> 00:34:23,400
