795
00:34:36,500 --> 00:34:39,433
until it has nowhere to go , and then ... Bam .

796
00:34:39,467 --> 00:34:41,467
I see .

797
00:34:41,500 --> 00:34:44,333
I think we 've still got Mrs Early there , in our outside broadcast studio .

798
00:34:44,367 --> 00:34:46,133
If she 's ... Yes . There you are .

799
00:34:46,167 --> 00:34:48,667
Mrs Early , I don 't know quite if you heard that ,

800
00:34:48,700 --> 00:34:50,700
