801
00:34:50,733 --> 00:34:54,600
Well , she said that Suzanne was the classic typical poltergeist focus .

802
00:34:54,633 --> 00:34:58,333
She was the person that all this energy was focusing on .

803
00:34:58,367 --> 00:35:00,067
What do you think about that ?

804
00:35:00,100 --> 00:35:04,267
Well , there 's nothing wrong with my Suzie . I know that .

805
00:35:04,300 --> 00:35:08,833
If my Suzie 's funny , well , how does that explain the other things like , erm ,

806
00:35:08,867 --> 00:35:12,067
