818
00:35:40,133 --> 00:35:43,433
Yeah , well , a lot of people would have it at one time that you couldn 't walk on the moon .

819
00:35:43,467 --> 00:35:46,567
All right . Well , in order to avoid any accusations of bias ,

820
00:35:46,600 --> 00:35:49,500
