840
00:36:32,467 --> 00:36:36,100
I mean , it 's all part of human experience and that 's what we 're studying .

841
00:36:36,133 --> 00:36:37,500
Well ... Fine , fine .

842
00:36:37,533 --> 00:36:39,067
But is it measurable ?

843
00:36:39,100 --> 00:36:41,333
Is it provable ? No ...

844
00:36:41,367 --> 00:36:45,267
For years , parapsychologists have been trying to prove their loony theories

845
00:36:45,300 --> 00:36:46,800
