846
00:36:46,833 --> 00:36:48,567
and they can 't .

847
00:36:48,600 --> 00:36:51,467
Yeah , that 's right . We can 't . That 's where we went wrong .

848
00:36:51,500 --> 00:36:54,067
There are some things you can 't demonstrate in a lab .

849
00:36:54,067 --> 00:36:56,533
Show me falling in love in a lab .

850
00:36:56,567 --> 00:36:59,300
Show me poetic inspiration in a lab .

851
00:36:59,333 --> 00:37:01,300
You can 't . You 've got to get out of the lab and into real life ,

852
00:37:01,333 --> 00:37:04,500
and that 's what we 're trying to do tonight .

853
00:37:04,533 --> 00:37:08,133
These people are not deceiving us or themselves . Look at them .

854
00:37:08,167 --> 00:37:11,233
They 're in trauma for God 's sake . Why would they do it to themselves ?

855
00:37:11,267 --> 00:37:15,067
The Early family are suffering just like people who 've had murder bereavements ,

856
00:37:15,100 --> 00:37:17,367
