857
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:21,067
The only difference is that nobody says that they don 't believe in plane crashes .

858
00:37:21,067 --> 00:37:24,067
But most of us don 't believe that people come back from them .

859
00:37:24,100 --> 00:37:26,200
See , that 's ...

860
00:37:26,233 --> 00:37:28,567
What you 're always forgetting , Emilio , is that you have a belief system , too .

861
00:37:28,600 --> 00:37:30,533
Your belief system is blanket denial .

862
00:37:30,567 --> 00:37:33,067
You joke about it because you 're afraid to face it .

863
00:37:34,067 --> 00:37:35,700
( SCOFFS ) That old chestnut .

864
00:37:35,733 --> 00:37:38,433
