868
00:37:45,533 --> 00:37:48,300
MICHAEL : Dr Sylvestri , for the moment , thank you very much indeed .

869
00:37:48,333 --> 00:37:50,833
I hope you 'll stay with us in our studio in New York ,

870
00:37:50,867 --> 00:37:52,567
