882
00:38:12,133 --> 00:38:14,167
No .

883
00:38:14,200 --> 00:38:17,567
Right . Do or do now . Let 's go straight over to Sarah in Foxhill Drive .

884
00:38:17,600 --> 00:38:18,700
Hang on .

885
00:38:18,733 --> 00:38:20,600
Sarah , what 's happening there ?

886
00:38:21,567 --> 00:38:22,800
It 's quite quiet , actually .

887
00:38:22,833 --> 00:38:24,533
A bit too quiet .

888
00:38:24,567 --> 00:38:25,733
Though , I must say , earlier on ,

