894
00:38:36,567 --> 00:38:38,433
Oh , yes , all right .

895
00:38:38,467 --> 00:38:39,800
Well , it was sort of a ghost story .

896
00:38:39,833 --> 00:38:41,833
- It happened ... - I can start another one .

897
00:38:41,867 --> 00:38:43,267
A couple of months ago now .

898
00:38:43,300 --> 00:38:45,667
We were staying at some friends of ours ' home .

899
00:38:45,700 --> 00:38:47,067
They live in the Cotswolds .

900
00:38:47,067 --> 00:38:50,533
Beautiful 15th , 16th century house .

901
00:38:50,567 --> 00:38:53,067
And one night ,

902
00:38:53,100 --> 00:38:57,067
I was woken up by the sound of this harpsichord music .

903
00:38:57,067 --> 00:38:58,433
It was like chamber music .

904
00:38:58,467 --> 00:39:01,600
But , you know , when a noise comes into your dream ,

905
00:39:01,633 --> 00:39:03,767
and you 're not quite sure it 's in the dream ,

906
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:05,667
or whether it 's actually happening .

907
00:39:05,700 --> 00:39:07,667
It was that kind of effect .

908
00:39:07,700 --> 00:39:09,733
But it woke me up nonetheless .

909
00:39:09,767 --> 00:39:12,333
And when I tried to get back to sleep again ,

910
00:39:12,367 --> 00:39:13,767
I could still hear it .

911
00:39:13,800 --> 00:39:17,500
But all I could see was this Indian woman 's face .

912
00:39:17,533 --> 00:39:21,333
And she had her hair sort of pulled across her forehead and then tightly back .

913
00:39:21,367 --> 00:39:23,100
And kohl around her eyes .

914
00:39:23,133 --> 00:39:24,833
And her eyes were going from side to side .

915
00:39:24,867 --> 00:39:27,200
You know , like in Indian dancing .

916
00:39:27,233 --> 00:39:31,100
And slowly , the eyes lifted up and rolled right back until they were white ,

917
00:39:31,133 --> 00:39:33,133
and then the face went .

918
00:39:33,167 --> 00:39:36,600
The next morning , I couldn 't wait to tell everybody about this .

919
00:39:36,633 --> 00:39:40,367
And the people whose house it is ...

920
00:39:40,400 --> 00:39:45,167
They told me that the house had once belonged to the viceroy of India .

921
00:39:45,200 --> 00:39:49,600
And he had had two Indian concubines living in the house with him .

922
00:39:49,633 --> 00:39:51,200
And when they died ,

923
00:39:51,233 --> 00:39:53,400
he couldn 't bury them in consecrated ground .

924
00:39:53,433 --> 00:39:57,400
He wasn 't allowed to . So he buried them out in his garden .

925
00:39:57,433 --> 00:40:00,833
And there had been talk in the village

926
00:40:00,867 --> 00:40:05,433
of actually digging up the grave to see what else was down there .

927
00:40:05,467 --> 00:40:07,767
And it became very clear to me that this was a sort of message to say ,

928
00:40:07,800 --> 00:40:10,367
" No , don 't . They mustn 't do it . "

929
00:40:10,400 --> 00:40:14,633
And so , when I found out that they weren 't in fact planning to do anything with the grave ,

930
00:40:14,667 --> 00:40:16,033
they wouldn 't dream of it ,

931
00:40:16,067 --> 00:40:18,067
I went back up to the bedroom ,

932
00:40:18,100 --> 00:40:21,300
and I just sort of said , " Don 't worry . Nothing 's going to happen . "

933
00:40:21,333 --> 00:40:24,667
And it was as though the atmosphere changed straightaway .

934
00:40:24,700 --> 00:40:28,267
I have to say Smithy was a bit scared the next night .

935
00:40:28,300 --> 00:40:30,767
He wouldn 't admit it , but he was .

936
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:32,567
But nothing happened .

937
00:40:32,600 --> 00:40:35,600
And it was as though everything had gone calm again .

938
00:40:35,633 --> 00:40:39,067
But the important thing here , it wasn 't scary . At all .

939
00:40:39,100 --> 00:40:41,700
I mean , the music and the vision was very beautiful .

940
00:40:41,733 --> 00:40:43,633
But ... That 's why I wanted to do this programme .

941
00:40:43,667 --> 00:40:45,067
' Cause it 's intriguing .

942
00:40:45,100 --> 00:40:47,067
- You all right ? - ( WHISPERING INDISTINCTLY )

943
00:40:47,100 --> 00:40:48,533
Okay , yeah .

944
00:40:48,567 --> 00:40:50,667
Kim just wants to go to bed now . It 's a bit late .

945
00:40:50,700 --> 00:40:53,100
