954
00:41:10,533 --> 00:41:12,467
Good night , Kim .

955
00:41:12,500 --> 00:41:14,233
DR PASCOE : Remember , there 's nothing to be scared of .

956
00:41:14,267 --> 00:41:15,733
To bed .

957
00:41:17,267 --> 00:41:19,233
