961
00:41:26,233 --> 00:41:27,500
I mean , all those things can harm us .

962
00:41:27,533 --> 00:41:29,233
But we can also understand them .

963
00:41:29,267 --> 00:41:30,600
All right ? Can I leave that light on ?

964
00:41:30,633 --> 00:41:33,200
- Yeah . Good night . - All right . Good night .

965
00:41:33,233 --> 00:41:34,667
- Keep warm . - Yep .

966
00:41:39,633 --> 00:41:43,200
MICHAEL : So , Sarah , got anything to report at all ?

967
00:41:43,233 --> 00:41:44,533
No . Nothing .

968
00:41:44,567 --> 00:41:46,333
Just the cold .

969
00:41:46,367 --> 00:41:48,300
It 's typical , isn 't it ?

970
00:41:48,333 --> 00:41:50,167
A house full of technology , and nobody 's bothered to find out

971
00:41:50,200 --> 00:41:52,733
