972
00:41:52,767 --> 00:41:54,400
You okay , Suzanne ?

973
00:41:54,433 --> 00:41:55,500
- Yes , I am . - Got your crisps ?

974
00:41:55,533 --> 00:41:58,367
- Yeah . - Yeah ? Good . All right .

975
00:41:58,400 --> 00:42:01,200
Now , guys , I think we 've earned ourselves a cup of coffee , don 't you ?

976
00:42:01,233 --> 00:42:02,500
MAN : Yeah .

977
00:42:02,533 --> 00:42:04,800
Pam told me where everything was , so ...

978
00:42:04,833 --> 00:42:07,100
