979
00:42:07,133 --> 00:42:09,233
Mike , how do you take the coffee ?

980
00:42:09,267 --> 00:42:10,533
MIKE A : Black , one sugar please .

981
00:42:10,567 --> 00:42:11,733
SARAH : Okay . What about you , Chris ?

982
00:42:11,767 --> 00:42:13,267
CHRIS : Milk , one sugar please .

983
00:42:16,200 --> 00:42:17,233
There we are .

984
00:42:18,300 --> 00:42:20,067
You know what ?

985
00:42:20,067 --> 00:42:24,067
I think I 'd almost feel happier if something was happening .

986
00:42:24,100 --> 00:42:28,733
It 's sort of eerier just waiting , really , don 't you find ?

987
00:42:28,767 --> 00:42:33,567
MIKE A : Well , I think , I might 've heard something earlier . Sort of ...

988
00:42:33,600 --> 00:42:36,133
Just like an animal scratching its feet , but

989
00:42:36,167 --> 00:42:38,300
