990
00:42:38,333 --> 00:42:39,767
- Really ? - MIKE A : Yeah .

991
00:42:39,800 --> 00:42:42,800
CHRIS : And I noticed earlier my watch had stopped .

992
00:42:42,833 --> 00:42:44,067
